# Kept out of release archives (`git archive`, and so the GitHub/Zenodo tarball)
# but still tracked, because a clone needs them.
#
# Only caches that no OFFLINE build reads. build.py and render.py read nine of
# the twelve files in data/cache, so excluding the directory wholesale would
# break `make curate` from the archive, which is the reason the archive is worth
# publishing at all. These three are inputs to the optional API-backed stages.
data/cache/llm.json           export-ignore
data/cache/pub_discovery.json export-ignore
data/cache/search_pubs.json   export-ignore
